cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the archived release."
title: "Bi2Te3 Deep Potential Workflow Package for Ultra-Flexibility Merges High Power Density in Single-Crystal Bi2Te3 Film Thermoelectric Generators"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-12
repository-code: "https://github.com/SimonkingCat/Bi2Te3-deepmd-workflow"
abstract: "Computational workflow, model metadata, representative inputs, and atomistic simulation outputs for the Bi2Te3 DeepMD/DPGEN/LAMMPS/VASP calculations used in the associated Nature Communications manuscript."
keywords:
  - Bi2Te3
  - bismuth telluride
  - thermoelectric materials
  - DeepMD-kit
  - DPGEN
  - LAMMPS
  - VASP
  - machine-learning interatomic potential
